94 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In modern classrooms, it is difficult for educators to consistently identify students who may be experiencing social isolation or emotional struggles. Prolonged isolation can have a negative impact on a student's well-being and academic performance. However, detecting and monitoring such patterns in a busy classroom environment is challenging without proper tools, leading to missed opportunities for timely intervention. There is a need for an automated solution that can help identify and track students who are potentially isolated, enabling educators to provide the necessary support.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
