<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 355 0 R
/E (Machine learning models trained to detect emotions and behaviors from facial expressions and body postures have been used extensively in educational research. While most models are aimed at detecting student engagement \(as demonstrated in [Mishra et al., 2019]\), there is emerging research in using deep learning for isolation detection.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
