184 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 357 0 R
/E (A key aspect of any student behavior tracking system is the ability to identify individuals. Facial recognition has been widely used in schools for attendance tracking and security purposes, as explored in [Zhao et al., 2020]. However, these systems raise important privacy and ethical considerations. Studies like [Lee & Park, 2020] emphasized the need for consent and strict data privacy protocols, especially when dealing with minors.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
185 0 obj
